{"id": "t176-002", "text": "Spoke to Siddharth on the phone. He's applied for the senior analyst role at the council and should hear back by the 3rd of June. If he gets an interview it'll be the week after, and he's already asked his old manager Teresa to be a referee. He's been at his current place for six years and is ready for a change.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "senior analyst role at the council", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 3rd of June"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "old manager", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at his current place for six years", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "ready for a change", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t176-004", "text": "Joy has her grade 6 piano exam on Saturday. Her teacher thinks she's ready but Joy doesn't.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 6 piano exam", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t176-008", "text": "Asha's husband is a paramedic and they've got two boys, both at the primary on Elm Road.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "paramedic", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boys", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the primary on Elm Road", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t176-011", "text": "Irina works nights at the hospital lab and lives with her sister in Croydon. Her parents are still in Bucharest and her dad runs a small garage there. She's been in the UK since 2015 and has just applied for citizenship, though she said the forms took her about three weekends to get through.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works nights at the hospital lab", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Croydon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Bucharest", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs a small garage", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "in the UK since 2015", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applied for citizenship", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t176-012", "text": "Ravi passed his driving test! Third attempt. Don't forget to get him a little keyring or something to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a little keyring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t176-014", "text": "Tariq's results day is Thursday. He's hoping for the grades to get into Manchester for engineering, otherwise it's Sheffield through clearing. His mum says he's pretending not to care but he hasn't eaten properly all week. His older sister Ruby got her results the same way two years ago and is taking him for breakfast that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results day", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hoping for the grades to get into Manchester for engineering", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "older sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two years ago", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakfast", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t176-017", "text": "Yetunde has her bar exams in February. She's revising every evening after work and said she's barely sleeping, which isn't like her. Her sister Joy is coming down to stay the week before to cook and keep her sane. I should check in on her in a couple of weeks, and maybe drop off some food.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exams", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down to stay", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a couple of weeks", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t176-027", "text": "Long chat with Dana after book club. She's finally applying for the head of HR role at the hospital trust, deadline is 30 September. Her boss is leaving at Christmas and she thinks she has a decent shot, but she's worried about the presentation part of the interview. Her husband Owen is going to do mock questions with her the weekend before. I should offer to read her personal statement.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of HR role at the hospital trust", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock questions", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to read her personal statement", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t176-035", "text": "Rosa's cat Biscuit is fourteen now. Rosa works from home most days so she can keep an eye on him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works from home most days", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t176-036", "text": "Owen didn't get the bank job. They said he came a close second. He's applying for a similar role in Cardiff.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bank job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "similar role in Cardiff", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t176-040", "text": "Helen's interview for the deputy head post was moved to 8 November because one of the governors is away. She's prepping all half term and has to give a twenty minute presentation on behaviour policy. She sounded confident but admitted she hasn't done an interview in eleven years. Remind me to ring her the evening before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview for the deputy head post", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "confident", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t176-043", "text": "Ignacio lives in Valencia with his parents while he finishes his PhD. His brother Javi teaches in Madrid.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Valencia", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "finishes his PhD", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "teaches", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t176-044", "text": "Yetunde's younger brother is starting his apprenticeship interview process. I said I'd help with mock interviews on the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "apprenticeship interview process", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock interviews", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t176-048", "text": "Teresa's son Haruto is applying to medical school. Interviews are in January and he has his UCAT on 2 August.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "medical school", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interviews", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "UCAT", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 August", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t176-049", "text": "Wiremu is from Rotorua originally. He's been in London about six years and works in construction.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Rotorua", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in London about six years", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "works in construction", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t176-052", "text": "Tomás Fischer has started at a law firm in Edinburgh. He's living in Leith with two friends from uni.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás Fischer", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at a law firm in Edinburgh", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "living in Leith", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "friends", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t176-056", "text": "Farid said the interview at the airport went well. They'll let him know by the end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the airport", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the month"}]}
